      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Finally, we pretrain a preliminary model showcasing the capabilities of a unified design, achieving strong results at 3B model scale (6.4T tokens), in both text generation, T2I tasks, and T2S tasks.",
